      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      69.72,
      267.24,
      545.12,
      285.64
    ],
    "text": "deceased person lying fallen and the three accused persons inside his house. Any",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      69.6,
      291.7,
      545.06,
      310.11
    ],
    "text": "reasonable man under these circumstances would think that the accused persons",
